OL,3,AIsrael's president begins consultations
OL,4,Awith parties after election deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's President Isaac Herzog has
OL,7,Fbegun consultations with political
OL,8,Fparties on whom to task with forming a
OL,9,Fnew coalition government, after he
OL,10,Freceived the official results of a
OL,11,Fgeneral election last week he said had
OL,12,Fno clear winner.
OL,14,FHerzog told party leaders that "not
OL,15,Fevery commitment and promise can be
OL,16,Ffulfilled" if they want to avoid a new
OL,17,Felection.
OL,19,FNeither the bloc of Prime Minister
OL,20,FBenjamin Netanyahu nor his rival Gadi
OL,21,FEisenkot secured a majority in
OL,22,Fparliament.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
