OL,3,AIsrael's president begins consultations
OL,4,Awith parties after election deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, electoral officials said there
OL,7,Fwas no evidence of irregularities and
OL,8,Fthat unsubstantiated claims by
OL,9,FNetanyahu's camp of Arab-led parties
OL,10,F"stealing" the election did not justify
OL,11,Fdelaying the results' certification.
